<title>USA: St. Mary Land completes sale of Russian.</title>
<headline>St. Mary Land completes sale of Russian.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>St. Mary Land and Exploration Co said it closed the sale of its 18 percent working interest in the Russian oil field Chernogorskoye, in western Siberia, to Ural Petroleum Corp for $17.2 million.</p>
<p>That amount consists of cash, the stock of Ural Petroleum common stock and an amount payable out of production, according to St. Mary.</p>
<p>The company said its book value of the Russian investment as of December 31 was $6.1 million.</p>
</text>
